## API skill files

Per-API agent references (one markdown file each):

- [Abstract](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/abstractapi/skill.md): Verify every user and stop fraud before it starts. Verify emails, phone numbers and IPs, block fraud and bots, and enrich your data with Abstract.
- [AgentMail](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/agentmail/skill.md): Programmatic email for AI agents. Create inboxes, send/receive emails, manage threads and drafts. Inboxes cost $2/month. Inboxes inactive for 30+ days are automatically deleted.
- [AgentPhone](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/agentphone/skill.md): Give your AI agent a real phone number. Make calls, send and receive messages across iMessage, WhatsApp, SMS and more to have conversations in the real world — all via API.
- [Airscale](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/airscale/skill.md): Airscale B2B data API: find professional and personal emails and mobile numbers, extract person and company profiles, reverse email/phone lookups, search people and companies for list building, company lookalikes, Airsearch web research, LinkedIn post and engagement data, website technologies, ad lookups, Google Maps search, email verification and DNC checks.
- [akta.pro](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/akta-pro/skill.md): akta.pro provides structured company data with deep private-company coverage, company discovery, real-time and historical news, business-event signals and alternative data for AI agents and data products. Built for financial-services platforms, PE/VC and investment teams, consulting and research workflows, GTM and revenue-intelligence products, and agent routers. Use it to enrich companies, build lists and market maps, monitor company or industry news, surface GTM and buying signals from events such as funding, M&A, leadership changes, hiring, launches and partnerships, and analyze headcount, jobs, website traffic, social activity, employee reviews and product reviews. Responses are structured, entity-resolved and compact for reliable agent routing and workflow automation.
- [AllModels](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/allmodels/skill.md): Unified TTS and STT API aggregating 18+ speech providers including Deepgram, ElevenLabs, OpenAI, AssemblyAI, Cartesia, Soniox, Groq, Fish Audio, MiniMax, Amazon Polly, Gemini, xAI Grok, and more. OpenAI and ElevenLabs SDK-compatible endpoints for text-to-speech synthesis, speech-to-text transcription, voice cloning, and voice discovery. Access 42+ TTS models and 39+ STT models through a single API key and unified interface.
- [Andi Search](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/andi/skill.md): AI Search for the Next Generation
- [AnyAPI](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/anyapi/skill.md): One API for hundreds of data operations: web search, scraping, social media profiles and posts (TikTok, Instagram, LinkedIn, X, YouTube and more), person and company enrichment, email finding and verification. Each operation takes normalized JSON input and returns a normalized result with its USD cost.
- [Apollo](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/apollo/skill.md): Apollo.io API for people and company enrichment, search, and prospecting. Access the Apollo database of 210M+ contacts and 30M+ companies.
- [Aviato](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/aviato/skill.md): Comprehensive company and person intelligence platform. Enrich companies and people, search with advanced DSL queries, get funding rounds, investments, employees, founders, contact info, LinkedIn social data, and market maps.
- [Baseten](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/baseten/skill.md): Baseten is a high-performance inference platform for running open source LLMs. This API provides an OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint, so it works as a drop-in replacement with any OpenAI SDK or client. Just swap the base URL and API key. Available models include DeepSeek V3 and V3.1, GLM 4.6 and 4.7 from Zhipu, Moonshot's Kimi K2 family (including K2 Thinking with 262k context), and OpenAI's GPT OSS 120B. Several models support controllable reasoning depth via a reasoning_effort parameter. Supports streaming, tool calling, structured outputs, and extended context windows up to 262k tokens.
- [Brand.dev](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/brand-dev/skill.md): API to personalize your product with logos, colors, and company info from any domain.
- [CaptainData](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/captaindata/skill.md): CaptainData API provides people and company enrichment, search, and discovery powered by LinkedIn Sales Navigator data. Find and enrich profiles, search for people and companies, and discover employees.
- [Company Enrich](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/company-enrich/skill.md): Comprehensive company and people data enrichment, search, and lead generation API. Enrich company profiles by domain or properties, search companies by industry/location/size/technology, find similar companies, search people by title/company/location, and more.
- [ContactOut](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/contactout/skill.md): Find anyone's email and phone number. Sales and recruitment intelligence with LinkedIn enrichment, people search, company search, email verification, and decision maker discovery.
- [Context.dev](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/context-dev/skill.md): API for retrieving context data from any website. Web scraping, brand retrieval, AI data extraction, screenshots, and more.
- [Coresignal](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/coresignal/skill.md): Business data intelligence platform providing company, employee, and job data from multiple sources. Access 3B+ regularly updated records via simple filters and data collection endpoints.
- [Crustdata](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/crustdata/skill.md): Comprehensive B2B data platform providing firmographic data, growth metrics, people profiles, and web intelligence for companies worldwide.
- [Didit](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/didit/skill.md): The all-in-one identity platform. Powering the fastest identity verification while fighting fraud and unifying all identity checks.
- [Edges](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/edges/skill.md): Edges provides LinkedIn automation actions for data extraction, search, and discovery. Extract profiles, companies, posts, jobs, events, and more. Search across LinkedIn and Sales Navigator.
- [Extruct AI](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/extruct-ai/skill.md): Extruct AI company research API. Semantic company search, lookalike company search, company profile lookup and enrichment, async deep search discovery tasks, and deep research report generation with citations. Find and discover companies using natural language queries, find similar companies to any domain, run AI-powered discovery tasks, and generate cited research reports on companies, people, and teams.
- [Fantastic Jobs](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/fantastic-jobs/skill.md): High-volume job postings feed. Indexes new ATS jobs hourly from 54 ATS platforms across 200k+ companies, plus job board listings from LinkedIn, Wellfound, and Y Combinator. Includes 20+ AI enrichments per job and deep company enrichments from LinkedIn, Glassdoor, and Crunchbase.
- [Financial Datasets](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/financial-datasets/skill.md): Stock market API with real-time and historical financial data for 27,000+ tickers over 30+ years. Financial statements, equity prices, insider trades, SEC filings, and more.
- [Findymail](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/findymail/skill.md): Findymail API for email finding, verification, company enrichment, phone lookup, intellimatch lead search, lookalike company search, technology stack lookup, and intent signals monitoring.
- [FullEnrich](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/fullenrich/skill.md): FullEnrich aggregates 20+ data providers for B2B contact enrichment, reverse email lookup, and people/company search. Find work emails, mobile phones, personal emails, and professional profiles.
- [Happenstance](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/happenstance/skill.md): Person research API. Submit a description of someone and get back a detailed profile including employment history, education, projects, writings, hobbies, and a summary.
- [Icypeas](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/icypeas/skill.md): Email finder, verifier, LinkedIn scraper, and lead database API. Discover professional email addresses, verify deliverability, scrape LinkedIn profiles and companies, and search a massive lead database with advanced filters.
- [Influencers Club](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/influencers-club/skill.md): Creator discovery, enrichment, and audience analytics across Instagram, YouTube, TikTok, Twitter, Twitch, and more. Search creators with advanced filters, enrich profiles by handle or email, find similar creators, compare audience overlap, and fetch content posts with engagement data.
- [Massive Web](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/joinmassive/skill.md): One API to chat with AI, browse, and search the live web. The Massive Web Render API turns hard-to-reach web content into clean, structured data. Supports AI completions (ChatGPT, Gemini, Perplexity, Copilot), web search with geotargeting, and full browser rendering with antibot bypass.
- [Leadsforge](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/leadsforge/skill.md): Leadsforge API for lead search, enrichment (email, phone, LinkedIn), company followers, and lookalike company discovery.
- [Linkup](https://www.orthogonal.com/discover/linkup/skill.md): Linkup is a web search engine for AI apps. We connect your AI application to the internet. Our API provides grounding data to enrich your AI’s output and increase its precision, accuracy and factuality.
